### ==========================================
### 用户管理 — User Management
### 路径前缀：/user
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 获取当前用户信息 -------------------
### @name Get Current User Detail
# 返回当前登录用户的详细信息（含角色、租户、工作空间列表）
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/detail HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 用户分页列表 -------------------
### @name Get User List (Page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/list?username=&pageNo=1&pageSize=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 创建用户 -------------------
### @name Create User
# 新增用户。password 为空则自动生成随机密码，返回中以 plainPassword 告知
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "",
  "nickName": "张三",
  "email": "zhangsan@example.com",
  "phone": "13800138001",
  "gender": "1",
  "status": "1"
}

### ------------------- 更新用户 -------------------
### @name Update User
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/update?userId=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickName": "张三（已修改）",
  "email": "zhangsan_new@example.com",
  "status": "1"
}

### ------------------- 删除用户 -------------------
### @name Delete User
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/delete?userId=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 重置密码 -------------------
### @name Reset Password
# 管理员重置指定用户的密码。password 为空则自动生成随机密码
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/password/reset?userId=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": ""
}

### ------------------- 修改密码 -------------------
### @name Change Password
# 用户自己修改密码，需验证旧密码。修改成功后该用户所有会话被踢出，需重新登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/password/change?userId=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "newPass123"
}
